    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1929124119293067286",
      "url": "https://x.com/hydcitypolice/status/1929124119293067286",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/hydcitypolice/status/1929124119293067286",
      "text": "𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐝𝐯𝐢𝐬𝐨𝐫𝐲\n\nDue to the ongoing drainage pipeline work near Akbar Plaza building, Old Malakpet, traffic diversion continued up to 8:00 AM on 02-06-2025.\n\n𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗜𝗖 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗧𝗥𝗜𝗖𝗧𝗘𝗗 𝗥𝗢𝗨𝗧𝗘𝗦:\n\nThe Traffic coming from MGBS and Chadarghat Bridge will not be allowed to proceed towards Chaderghat ‘X’ Roads and Malakpet. \n\nThe traffic coming from Koti, and Rangamahal through Chadarghat will not be allowed towards Chaderghat Rotary, Chaderghat Chota Bridge and Malakpet.\n\n𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗜𝗖 𝗗𝗜𝗩𝗘𝗥𝗦𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗥𝗢𝗨𝗧𝗘𝗦:\n\nRTC buses coming from MGBS exit gate and proceeding towards Vijayawada, Suryapet, Nalgonda, Khammam traffic will be diverted at Chaderghat Rotary towards Chaderghat X Roads – Nimboliadda - Amberpet new flyover- Ramatapur – Uppal - LB Nagar, towards Vijayawada highway and also the Busses going to Kalwakurty, Dewarakonda, Srisailam, will be diverted through the same route only.\n\n𝗔𝗹𝗹 𝗣𝗿𝗶𝘃𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗧𝗿𝗮𝘃𝗲𝗹 𝗕𝘂𝘀𝗲𝘀 𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗿𝗲𝗾𝘂𝗲𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗡𝗢𝗧 𝗧𝗢 𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝗶𝗻𝘁𝗼 𝗛𝘆𝗱𝗲𝗿𝗮𝗯𝗮𝗱 𝗖𝗶𝘁𝘆 𝗹𝗶𝗺𝗶𝘁𝘀 𝘂𝗽𝘁𝗼 𝟴:𝟬𝟬 𝗔𝗠 𝗼𝗻 𝟬𝟮-𝟬𝟲-𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱.\n\n𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗱𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗖𝗶𝘁𝘆 𝗥𝗧𝗖 𝗕𝘂𝘀𝗲𝘀 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝗲𝗲𝗱𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘁𝗼𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗱𝘀 𝗗𝗶𝗹𝘀𝗵𝘂𝗸𝗻𝗮𝗴𝗮𝗿, 𝗟𝗕 𝗡𝗮𝗴𝗮𝗿, 𝗦𝗮𝗶𝗯𝗮𝗯𝗮𝗱, 𝗜𝗯𝗿𝗮𝗵𝗶𝗺𝗽𝗮𝘁𝗻𝗮𝗺 will be diverted at Chaderghat X roads, Nimboliadda, 6 No Junction, New Golnaka bridge, Musarambagh RTA, Musarambagh X roads, Left turn towards Dilshuknagar and right turn towards Nalgonda X roads, Chanchalguda, Saidabad, IS Sadan.\n\nDuring traffic diversions, there might be traffic congestions at MJ Market, Koti, Rang Mahal  ‘X’ Roads, Chaderghat, SJ Rotary, Nimboliadda, Golnaka etc.  Hence, the commuters may choose alternate routes to reach their destinations. \n\n𝗗𝗜𝗩𝗘𝗥𝗦𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗣𝗢𝗜𝗡𝗧𝗦\n\nMGBS Rear gate (Mirchowk Traffic PS)\n\nChaderghar Rotary (Malakpet Traffic PS)\n\nAzampura x roads (Malakpet Traffic PS)\n\nAzampura x roads near Bharat petrol bunk (Malakpet Traffic PS)\n\nMalakpet Causeway (Malakpet Traffic PS)\n\nMalakpet T Jn., petrol bunk (Malakpet Traffic PS)\n\nChaderghat Chota bridge entry point (Kachiguda Traffic PS)\n\nChaderghat X Roads (Kachiguda Traffic PS)\n\n6 No. Junction (Amberpet Traffic PS)",
